{"t":"Key 4503","s":"key-4503-5402e","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Copper_Key_a0bf0e.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"number\">Key 4503</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Copper Key\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Copper_Key_a0bf0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also Known As</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Folda Restricted Area Key, Minotaur Archer Dungeon Key</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Item Class</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Copper Key </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.00 oz.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"origin\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Origin</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">In a treasure <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32031,31687,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">chest (32031, 31687, 8)</a> under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Islands\">Ice Islands</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"shortnotes\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-valu